----------------------------------------------------------------------
Methods
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The training procedure of scripts/mq_stage1.py and scripts/mq_stage2.py follows
the steps described in RADLADS (Goldstein, Alcaide, Lu, Cheah;
arXiv:2505.03005). No code from that work is included.
